      <VERS vnumber="1">And it came to pass, that <gr str="6256">after </gr>the <gr str="8141">year </gr>had <gr str="8666">ended</gr>, at the <gr str="6256">time </gr>that <gr str="4428">kings </gr>go <gr str="3318">out </gr>
